rows.en:
"Heh heh heh...
Don't be shy.
I'll let you meet him."{p}

Oh, the happy look on his face at that moment...!
Without even wiping away the blood running down him, he dashed straight into the school building and vanished.
Dying without ever once setting foot in a classroom must have left him with terrible regret.{p}

"I'm sorry.
Actually... I was joking."
I apologized in a small voice.{p}

That boy who said he liked me... he died, all of a sudden.
On the train tracks, in the middle of the night...
...They wrote it off as suicide, but I just can't accept that.{p}

Yuya is always at my side, watching me intently.
...Yes.
Even now, at this very moment...☆{p}

And now someone has finally died...
So please, I'm begging you, don't make Yuya angry.
The beloved one who stands behind me...{p}

Listen, spirit rapping.
Yuya is angry.
He's watching everything from behind me, you know...{p}
